This directory carries unchanged MegaMoE headers from chronarion/derpseek,
commit fd3f9981468ac5bf0cdf30392f5baf7d9c1c6db8:
https://github.com/chronarion/derpseek/tree/fd3f9981468ac5bf0cdf30392f5baf7d9c1c6db8/engine/overlay/megamoe_fork

DerpSeek adds direct host-memory expert reads and a separate scheduling lane.
The headers derive from DeepSeek's DeepGEMM through Garner McCloud's ds41
recipe and chronarion's dsv41 integration. The original header comments and
license texts are retained in LICENSE.DeepGEMM, LICENSE.ds41 and LICENSE.DerpSeek.

Flare's Python binding prepares a private include tree for kernel compilation
before graph capture. It does not change the carried CUDA implementations.
